{"authors": [], "discovered_at": "2026-11-13T03:20:57.053123Z", "id": "github:release:997737944:release:442700379", "kind": "release", "matched_terms": [], "metadata": {"action": "released", "draft": false, "forks": 13559, "prerelease": false, "stars": 104182, "stars_delta": 106, "tag_name": "v3702"}, "organization": "ruvnet", "priority": {"source": 0.5}, "published_at": "2026-11-12T09:00:34Z", "related_items": [], "scores": {}, "source": "github", "source_id": "997737944:release:442700379", "summary": "Source snapshot validated by the CI pipeline. This entry does not contain firmware bundles.\n\n**Changes:**\nfix: crates.io publish-blocking gaps in homecore-automation, homecore-hap (#1496)\n\nhomecore-automation's and homecore-hap's path dependency on homecore had\nno version requirement -- crates.io rejects \"all dependencies must have\na version requirement specified when publishing\". Pinned both to\nhomecore = \"0.1.0-alpha.0\", the version just published.\n\nAlso fixed homecore-hap's repository field, which pointed at\ngithub.com/ruvnet/wifi-densepose (a 404) instead of the actual\ngithub.com/ruvnet/RuView -- inconsistent with every other homecore-*\ncrate's Cargo.toml.\n\nFound while publishing the full homecore-* batch to crates.io (homecore,\n-api, -automation, -assist, -hap, -migrate, -plugins, -recorder,\n-server -- all 9, v0.1.0-alpha.0). Both crates verified via\ncargo publish --dry-run before and after.\n\n**Source commit:** `094e1400719ded1283c67d23b9c737f6738a3244`\n\nContainer images publish separately through the [sensing-server release workflow](https://github.com/ruvnet/RuView/actions/workflows/sensing-server-docker.yml).\nFirmware downloads are attached to the dedicated `vX.Y.Z-esp32` releases.\n", "title": "ruvnet/RuView CI snapshot v3702", "topics": ["object_detection", "spatial_intelligence"], "updated_at": "2026-11-12T09:00:34Z", "url": "https://github.com/ruvnet/RuView/releases/tag/v3702", "venue": null}
